WorkGuardian
Enterprise Chrome Extension & Admin Dashboard for Google Workspace
WorkGuardian is a comprehensive device monitoring and management solution built for schools, businesses, and organizations running Google Workspace. It gives administrators full visibility and control over every Chrome device in their organization — in real time.

What It Does
Website Blocking
Block any website instantly across all managed devices. Add individual domains, apply category presets (social media, streaming, gaming, gambling), or build custom block lists. Blocks take effect within 10 seconds of being saved on the dashboard — no manual updates required.
Real-Time Screen Monitoring
View live screenshots and continuous screen captures of any active device. The admin dashboard displays the latest snapshot of what every student or employee is currently looking at, updated automatically in the background.
Live Video Streaming
Stream a device's screen in real time directly to the admin dashboard with under 500ms latency. Admins can request a live view of any online device at any time with a single click.
Full Tab Visibility
See every open browser tab on every device — including the page title, URL, favicon, and whether the tab is active, pinned, or playing audio. Tab data updates automatically every 20 seconds and on every navigation.
Remote Device Control
Send commands to any device instantly from the dashboard:

Lock and unlock the screen remotely
Close individual tabs or all off-task tabs at once
Open a specific URL on a student's device
Force a device into single-site focus mode
Push quick links that appear on the device immediately

Two-Way Chat
Send messages directly to any device or broadcast to all devices at once. Messages appear as a non-dismissible chat bubble on the student's screen. Students can reply and the conversation is logged in the dashboard.
Web Filtering Scenes
Apply pre-configured browsing modes across all devices instantly:

Allowlist mode — students can only visit sites you approve
Blocklist scene — temporarily add extra blocks on top of the permanent list
Built-in presets: Testing Mode, Google Focus, Research Mode, No Social Media

Student Engagement Tracking
Monitor how actively each student is engaging with their work. WorkGuardian tracks focus time, tab switches, scroll depth, keystroke activity, and idle periods — compiled into a per-student engagement score visible on the dashboard.
Activity Timeline
A full chronological log of every URL visited, tab opened, site blocked, message sent, and command executed across all devices. Filter by device, event type, or date range.
Advanced Security & Anti-Tamper
WorkGuardian includes over 50 built-in security systems that run silently in the background:

Prevents students from deleting or bypassing the extension's monitoring elements
Detects DevTools usage and debugger attempts
Blocks attempts to use VPNs, proxies, or other bypass tools
Monitors clipboard activity, WebSocket connections, and audio capture
Detects off-task behavior and automatically escalates — sending a warning at 2 minutes, locking the screen at 5 minutes
Assigns a suspicion score to each tab based on behavioral signals

Google Workspace Integration
WorkGuardian reads the signed-in Google account from each device, linking all monitoring data directly to the student or employee's Workspace identity. Deploy to your entire organization in minutes using Google Admin Console — no manual installation on individual devices required.

Who It's For

Schools & Universities — Keep students on task during class, exams, and independent study
Businesses — Monitor device usage, enforce acceptable use policies, and protect company data
IT Administrators — Centrally manage Chrome device policies without touching individual machines


How It Works
WorkGuardian has two components:

The Chrome Extension — Installs silently on managed devices via Google Admin. Runs in the background with no visible interface. Monitors activity, enforces blocking rules, and responds to admin commands — all automatically.
The Admin Dashboard — A web-based control panel where administrators manage all connected devices, view live activity, send commands, configure blocking rules, and review historical logs.

The extension and dashboard communicate continuously. Blocking rules and commands pushed from the dashboard reach devices within 10 seconds. Device data — tabs, screenshots, activity — is reported to the dashboard every 20 seconds and on every navigation event.

Privacy & Compliance
WorkGuardian is designed for use on organization-owned and managed devices only. It is deployed exclusively through Google Admin Console, ensuring it can only be installed by authorized administrators within a verified Google Workspace organization. All monitoring data is transmitted securely to your organization's own dashboard and is not shared with any third parties.

